      propertyPath: m_Text
      value: 'Left Stick - Move (on the ground, while not aiming)

        Left Stick
        (in the air) - Nudge distance / drift sideways

        Left Trigger - Aim
        (hold; the cube stays put)

        Left Stick (while aiming) - Adjust aim
        direction

        Right Trigger - Launch

        South - Show/hide the
        landing preview

        Right Stick - Camera

        Start / Options /
        Esc - Pause


        (Hold-Release and Analog launch schemes are still in
        the project, just disabled)'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
